#    value apart with IsInstanceOf(Map) / IsInstanceOf(List)); HashMap.entrySet
#    keeps answering null (step 145) rather than the preferences map's.
#  - a list's Iterator.next answers the element; it wrapped every element in a
#    Map.Entry, which only a preferences map's entry set means.
#  - Throwable.getMessage on a FirebaseFirestoreException is its message.
#  - the enum constants and SetOptions.OVERWRITE of Firestore's classes are
#    static fields with a host value.
